# Synthetic school knowledge (standards-and-assessments.facts).
3.OA.A.2 | is_a | Common Core standard | 3.OA.A.2 is a Common Core standard: interpret a quotient as the size of equal shares or the number of shares.
3.OA.C.7 | is_a | Common Core standard | 3.OA.C.7 is a Common Core standard: fluently multiply and divide within one hundred.
3.NF.A.1 | is_a | Common Core standard | 3.NF.A.1 is a Common Core standard: see a unit fraction as one part of a whole cut into equal parts.
4.NBT.A.1 | is_a | Common Core standard | 4.NBT.A.1 is a Common Core standard: see that a digit is worth ten times the same digit one place to its right.
4.NF.A.1 | is_a | Common Core standard | 4.NF.A.1 is a Common Core standard: explain why fractions are equivalent and generate equivalent fractions.
4.NF.A.2 | is_a | Common Core standard | 4.NF.A.2 is a Common Core standard: compare fractions that have different numerators and denominators.
5.NF.A.1 | is_a | Common Core standard | 5.NF.A.1 is a Common Core standard: add and subtract fractions with unlike denominators.
5.NF.B.4 | is_a | Common Core standard | 5.NF.B.4 is a Common Core standard: multiply a fraction by a fraction or a whole number.
5.NBT.A.3 | is_a | Common Core standard | 5.NBT.A.3 is a Common Core standard: read, write and compare decimals.
6.NS.A.1 | is_a | Common Core standard | 6.NS.A.1 is a Common Core standard: divide fractions by fractions and interpret the quotient.
6.RP.A.1 | is_a | Common Core standard | 6.RP.A.1 is a Common Core standard: use ratio language to describe how two quantities relate.
6.RP.A.2 | is_a | Common Core standard | 6.RP.A.2 is a Common Core standard: understand a unit rate and use rate language.
6.RP.A.3 | is_a | Common Core standard | 6.RP.A.3 is a Common Core standard: solve ratio and rate problems with tables, unit rates, percent and unit conversion.
7.RP.A.2 | is_a | Common Core standard | 7.RP.A.2 is a Common Core standard: recognize and represent proportional relationships between quantities.
8.EE.B.5 | is_a | Common Core standard | 8.EE.B.5 is a Common Core standard: graph proportional relationships and read the unit rate as the slope.
8.EE.C.7 | is_a | Common Core standard | 8.EE.C.7 is a Common Core standard: solve linear equations in one variable.
MS-PS2-2 | is_a | Next Generation Science Standard | MS-PS2-2 is a Next Generation Science Standard: relate a change in an object's motion to the forces on it and its mass.
